// دقيق v4: تحليل استيراد لكل ملف ui مع استبعاد ملفه نفسه (يزيل التشابه الذاتي بأسماء الحزم)
// ثم إعادة تقييم الاعتماديات بعد حذف الملفات الزائدة
import fs from "node:fs";
import path from "node:path";

const root = process.cwd();
function walk(dir, out = []) {
  for (const e of fs.readdirSync(dir, { withFileTypes: true })) {
    const p = path.join(dir, e.name);
    if (e.isDirectory()) walk(p, out);
    else out.push(p);
  }
  return out;
}

const srcFiles = walk(path.join(root, "src")).filter((f) => /\.(ts|tsx)$/.test(f));
const contents = new Map(srcFiles.map((f) => [f, fs.readFileSync(f, "utf8")]));

function importedByOthers(name, selfFile) {
  const re = new RegExp(`(?:from\\s*|import\\s*\\(\\s*)["'][^"']*?/${name}["']|from\\s*["']\\./${name}["']`);
  for (const [f, txt] of contents) {
    if (path.resolve(f) === path.resolve(selfFile)) continue;
    if (re.test(txt)) return path.relative(root, f);
  }
  return null;
}

console.log("=== ui: من يستورد كل ملف؟ (باستثناء نفسه) ===");
const uiDir = path.join(root, "src/components/ui");
const unusedUi = [];
for (const f of fs.readdirSync(uiDir)) {
  const n = f.replace(/\.tsx?$/, "");
  const by = importedByOthers(n, path.join(uiDir, f));
  if (by) console.log(` USED  ${f} ← ${by}`);
  else { unusedUi.push(f); console.log(` UNUSED ${f}`); }
}

console.log("=== sooqy: من يستورد pull-to-refresh؟ ===");
const ptr = path.join(root, "src/components/sooqy/pull-to-refresh.tsx");
console.log(" by:", importedByOthers("pull-to-refresh", ptr) || "لا أحد");

// محتوى جديد بدون الملفات الزائدة
const unusedSet = new Set(unusedUi.map((f) => path.join(uiDir, f)));
unusedSet.add(ptr);
const cleanedSrc = [...contents.entries()].filter(([f]) => !unusedSet.has(f)).map(([, t]) => t).join("\n");
const rootCfg = ["vite.config.ts", "vitest.config.ts", "eslint.config.js", "capacitor.config.ts", "tsconfig.json", "src/styles.css", "scripts/apply-migrations.mjs", "scripts/build-mobile.mjs", "scripts/serve-static.mjs", ".github/workflows/android.yml"]
  .map((f) => (fs.existsSync(f) ? fs.readFileSync(f, "utf8") : "")).join("\n");
const pkg = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync("package.json", "utf8"));
const all = cleanedSrc + rootCfg + JSON.stringify(pkg.scripts);

console.log("=== الاعتماديات بعد الحذف ===");
const skip = new Set(["eslint", "prettier", "typescript", "vite", "vitest", "jsdom", "@vitejs/plugin-react", "globals", "typescript-eslint", "eslint-plugin-react-hooks", "eslint-plugin-react-refresh", "eslint-plugin-prettier", "eslint-config-prettier", "@eslint/js", "@types/node", "@types/react", "@types/react-dom", "@types/leaflet", "@testing-library/react", "@testing-library/jest-dom", "react", "react-dom", "tailwindcss", "@tailwindcss/vite", "vite-tsconfig-paths", "@fontsource/tajawal", "@capacitor/core", "@capacitor/cli", "@capacitor/android", "@supabase/supabase-js", "@tanstack/react-router", "@tanstack/react-start", "@tanstack/react-query", "clsx", "tailwind-merge", "class-variance-authority", "lucide-react", "leaflet", "react-leaflet", "pg"]);
const unusedDeps = [];
for (const dep of Object.keys({ ...pkg.dependencies, ...pkg.devDependencies })) {
  if (skip.has(dep)) continue;
  const hit = all.includes(dep) || all.includes(dep.split("/").pop());
  if (!hit) unusedDeps.push(dep);
}
unusedDeps.forEach((d) => console.log(" -", d));

console.log("=== أين تُستخدم الاعتماديات غير البديهية؟ ===");
for (const d of ["react-hook-form", "date-fns", "sonner", "embla-carousel-react", "vite-plugin-pwa", "input-otp", "zod"]) {
  const m = cleanedSrc.match(new RegExp(`["'][^"']*${d}[^"']*["']`, "g")) || [];
  console.log(` ${d}: ${[...new Set(m)].slice(0, 3).join(", ") || "— لا شيء —"}`);
}
console.log("=== styles.css: tw-animate-css؟ ===");
console.log((fs.readFileSync("src/styles.css", "utf8").match(/tw-animate|@import[^;]+;/g) || []).join("\n"));
